# Liveness / readiness for harrier_api.
#
# Works with the VS Code REST Client extension and the JetBrains HTTP Client
# (both read the `@name = value` file variables and `###` separators below).
# Start a server first, e.g.  HARRIER_MODELS=270m,0.6b target/release/harrier_api

@host = http://localhost:3000

### Health — status, version, uptime, loaded models, compiled backends
# @name health
GET {{host}}/health

### The root path serves the same payload
GET {{host}}/
